  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">New Democracy Fund Moldova 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this programme is to enhance and empower Moldovan civil society and citizen engagement of all genders in democracy and governance processes, and strengthening its resilience towards &#x201c;meeting&#x201d; new political and social challenges caused by the war in Ukraine. The outcome is to further democracy, democratic engagement and civil society.</narrative>
