    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Culture: The Coalition of Independent Cultural Actors (hereinafter CICS) has developed and adopted the organisational strategy adequate to the needs and resources of the organisation</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2024-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2024-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="CISC organisational strategy developed and adopted"></target>
     <actual value="CSCI organisational strategy is in development. Due to the focus on the organisational structure, CSCI have re-defined the member involvement in the strategy development. The strategy of the NGO is now developed in a yearly weekend seminar for all members in a participatory way. The strategy for 2025-2030 is not done yet but under development. The members were the seminar in December 2024"></actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="A plan for a new admin/organisational set-up for the CICS secretariat developed and realised"></target>
     <actual value="CSCIs organizational 2023-2025 strategy was adapted after  being developed through a participatory approach of its members, using democratic approaches to identifying main needs and interests in the sector. CSCI additionally started the development of the 2026-2030 strategy using the same methodology and building on different formats of knowledge collection implemented as part of the capacity building program within the project phase"></actual>
    </period>
